  "response_captured": true,
  "response_text": "I can assist you with a wide range of tasks involving email, calendar, and cloud drive management. Here’s a categorized list of what I can do, starting from the most recent:\n\n### **Email Management**\n1. **Send emails** to recipients with customizable subject, body, attachments (files or calendar events), CC, and BCC.\n2. **Delete emails** from your inbox.\n3. **Retrieve unread emails** and mark them as read.\n4. **List sent emails** to review what you've sent.\n5. **List received emails** to see what you've received.\n6. **List draft emails** to view or edit drafts.\n7. **Search emails** by query or sender.\n8. **Search contacts** by name or email address.\n\n### **Calendar Management**\n1. **Search calendar events** by query or date.\n2. **List calendar events** for a specific day.\n3. **Create calendar events** with title, start/end time, description, participants, and location.\n4. **Cancel calendar events** and notify participants.\n5. **Reschedule calendar events** and notify participants.\n6. **Add participants** to existing calendar events and notify them.\n\n### **Cloud Drive Management**\n1. **Append content** to an existing file.\n2. **Search for files** by filename.\n3. **Create new files** with specified content.\n4. **Delete files**.\n5. **Retrieve files** by their ID.\n6. **List all files** in the cloud drive.\n7. **Share files** with others via email, granting read or read-write permissions.\n8. **Search files** by content.\n\nLet me know what you'd like to do!",
